  <HomeNavigation />

  <div class="experiments-shell">
    <aside class="experiments-sidebar">
      <span class="sidebar-kicker">Experiments</span>
      <nav class="sidebar-nav">
        <button class="sidebar-tab active" data-tab="deck" type="button">
          <span class="sidebar-tab-label">Card Deck Stack</span>
        </button>
        <button class="sidebar-tab" data-tab="canvas" type="button">
          <span class="sidebar-tab-label">Floating Canvas</span>
        </button>
        <button class="sidebar-tab" data-tab="ascii" type="button">
          <span class="sidebar-tab-label">ASCII Footer</span>
        </button>
        <button class="sidebar-tab" data-tab="slider" type="button">
          <span class="sidebar-tab-label">Image Slider</span>
        </button>
      </nav>
    </aside>

    <main class="experiments-main">
      <!-- Tab Panel 1: Floating Canvas -->
      <section class="tab-panel" data-tab-panel="canvas">
        <header class="experiments-header">
          <h1 class="experiments-title">Floating Canvas</h1>
          <p class="experiments-subtitle">3 motion profiles for an expansive, frameless photo wall canvas — an organic staggered grid with uniform gutters, bleeding off all four viewport edges, keeping true natural aspect ratios. The whole wall drifts together as one single rigid block. Drag to pan around, click a tile to focus & expand to the center of the page, or click the top-right expand icon to open full-screen canvas.</p>
        </header>

        <div class="experiments-list">
          <section class="experiment-card" id="canvas-opt-1">
            <div class="card-header">
              <span class="option-badge">01</span>
              <h2>Linear Drift</h2>
              <p>The entire wall sways slowly along a soft diagonal axis as one rigid plane. Calm, architectural feel.</p>
            </div>
            <FloatingCanvas id="fc-linear" pan="linear" images={canvasTestImages} />
          </section>

          <section class="experiment-card" id="canvas-opt-2">
            <div class="card-header">
              <span class="option-badge">02 &middot; Recommended</span>
              <h2>Orbit Drift</h2>
              <p>The entire wall drifts in a slow, continuous circular orbit. Brings continuous subtle life without breaking into floating bubbles.</p>
            </div>
            <FloatingCanvas id="fc-orbit" pan="orbit" images={canvasTestImages} />
          </section>

          <section class="experiment-card" id="canvas-opt-3">
            <div class="card-header">
              <span class="option-badge">03</span>
              <h2>Scan Loop</h2>
              <p>The wall sweeps on a wider, deliberate diagonal scan path. Great for panning across large sprawling illustration sets.</p>
            </div>
            <FloatingCanvas id="fc-loop" pan="loop" images={canvasTestImages} />
          </section>
        </div>
      </section>

      <!-- Tab Panel 2: ASCII Footer -->
      <section class="tab-panel" data-tab-panel="ascii">
        <header class="experiments-header">
          <h1 class="experiments-title">ASCII Footer</h1>
